The issue is in `clsString.h`: your static split function is currently named **`plit`**, not `Split`.

You likely have this call somewhere:

```cpp
clsString::Split(Line, Seperator);
```

But in `clsString.h`, you currently have:

```cpp
static vector<string> plit(string str1, string delim = " ")
```

and:

