## Why this fixes it

### Problem 1

You choose `1`, the program shows the list, then immediately executes:

```cpp
system("pause>0");
ShowMainMenue();
```

On Linux, `pause>0` does not pause, so it instantly returns to the menu.

### Problem 2

Clients were loaded from:

```text
Clients.txt
```

in the working directory, not from:

```text
data/Clients.txt
```

So the clients vector could be empty.

After these changes, rebuild the project and test with:

```text
User2
1234
```

Then choose:

```text
1
```

The clients list should stay visible until you press Enter.

